    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1.8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf mon ðone hlaford teo, þæt he be his ræde uthleope ⁊ ær unriht worhte, nime him fif ðegnas to ⁊ beo him sylf syxta ladie hine ðæs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the lord is accused of advising the man who had done wrong to escape, he shall choose five thegns, and shall himself make a sixth, and shall clear himself of the accusation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf mon þone hlaford teo, þæt he be his ræde utthleope ⁊ ær unriht worhte, nime him fif þegnas to ⁊ beo him sylf sixta ladie hine þæs.</ab>
      </div>
